//huynhhieutravel.com/?attachment_id=5309" class="wp-image-5309" srcset="https://media.huynhhieutravel.com/trẻ-em-ở-vùng-khó-khăn-ninh-thuận.jpg 1280w, https://media.huynhhieutravel.com/trẻ-em-ở-vùng-khó-khăn-ninh-thuận-768x430.jpg 768w, https://media.huynhhieutravel.com/trẻ-em-ở-vùng-khó-khăn-ninh-thuận-696x390.jpg 696w, https://media.huynhhieutravel.com/trẻ-em-ở-vùng-khó-khăn-ninh-thuận-1068x598.jpg 1068w, https://media.huynhhieutravel.com/trẻ-em-ở-vùng-khó-khăn-ninh-thuận-750x420.jpg 750w" sizes="(max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px" /><figcaption class="blocks-gallery-item__caption">Trẻ em vùng khó khăn Ninh Thuận</figcaption></figure></li><li class="blocks-gallery-item"><figure><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1280" height="717" src="https://media.huynhhieutravel.com/trẻ-em-Raglai.jpg" alt="Trẻ em Raglai" data-id="5310" data-full-url="https://media.huynhhieutravel.com/trẻ-em-Raglai.jpg" data-link="https://huynhhieutravel.com/?attachment_id=5310" class="wp-image-5310" srcset="https://media.huynhhieutravel.com/trẻ-em-Raglai.jpg 1280w, https://media.huynhhieutravel.com/trẻ-em-Raglai-768x430.jpg 768w, https://media.huynhhieutravel.com/trẻ-em-Raglai-696x390.jpg 696w, https://media.huynhhieutravel.com/trẻ-em-Raglai-1068x598.jpg 1068w, https://media.huynhhieutravel.com/trẻ-em-Raglai-750x420.jpg 750w" sizes="(max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px" /><figcaption class="blocks-gallery-item__caption">Trẻ em Raglai</figcaption></figure></li></ul></figure>



<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Cách thức tham gia câu lạc bộ Tia Sáng</h2>



